-- check/bad: a mismatch at an argument of `Basics.eq`, called by name,
-- names the function the program called. The six comparison operators
-- lower to method calls, so a call of their core function is always one
-- written by hand; it was reported as "the 2nd argument to (==)", an
-- operator this program never wrote.
x : Bool
x =
    Basics.eq 1 "a"
